 "notes": [
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0659.mbb#0.311",
   "note": "Labelled Sandrock (script id 76, shift checked against 0.305-0.307). Odd line for Quatre right after the narration; may be a branch where the team meets Sandrock/Heavyarms again. Kept as labelled."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0660.mbb#0.7",
   "note": "'nantoka na' answers Ankh's 'are you alive' -> 'Just barely'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0660.mbb#0.8",
   "note": "Leader block 0.8-0.22, Pt_Chara_Check order k0-14 = 00, Wing Zero, God Gundam, Nu, Zeta, Zero, Mebius, OOO, W(Shotaro), Den-O Sword, Taro, Seven, Ultraman, Black RX, Rider 1. Polite variants 0.14/0.15 (Mebius/OOO) -> 'Where is Seravee!?'; 0.17 (Momotaros, 'no yatsu') -> 'that Seravee guy'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0660.mbb#0.23",
   "note": "Cherudim: 'yatsu' = Seravee, restored as 'him' (glossary g=m)."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0660.mbb#0.29",
   "note": "Gaga shouts Trans-Am (kamikaze charge); glossary Trans-Am."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0660.mbb#0.31",
   "note": "'Konna tokoro de' with dropped verb; restored as 'I'm not going down in a place like this'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.1",
   "note": "0661 speaker labels are shifted by one entry in speakers.json (extractor assumed base shift 1; content and script show +n -> entry n here). Correct mapping: 0.1-0.15 leader block, 0.16 Gaddess (id 200), 0.19-0.33 leader block, 0.34 Ankh, 0.35 Garazzo (id 202), 0.36-0.50 leader block, 0.51 Ankh. So the labels on 0.19 (Gaddess), 0.37 (Ankh), 0.38 (Garazzo) are wrong; they are leader variants. 0.35 'we Innovators' cannot be a hero line, which confirms this."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.16",
   "note": "Unlabelled; Gaddess (script speaker 200) launching her GN Fangs."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.20",
   "note": "'Doko da' while being shot by unseen Fangs -> 'Where are you!?', matching earlier slices' rendering of the same line."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.28",
   "note": "Momotaros variant (k9): rude, 'hikyoumono' at full strength -> 'You coward!!'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.34",
   "note": "Ankh (script +34, id 36). Subject unstated: the enemies' (Gaddess/Fangs) reactions -> 'They're reacting faster than before!!'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.35",
   "note": "Garazzo (script id 202, Bring Stabity), not a leader variant."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0661.mbb#0.36",
   "note": "Leader block 0.36-0.50 continues into story_139 (0.48-0.50); same k order as above."
  }
 ],
 "report": "80/80 examined. 0661 speaker labels are off by one in speakers.json (0.19 Gaddess / 0.37 Ankh / 0.38 Garazzo are really leader variants; Ankh = 0.34, Garazzo = 0.35, Gaddess = 0.16). 0659#0.311 labelled Sandrock but reads oddly for him. No names outside the glossary."
